OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,6,     F4/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,7,     Fcomposer's role in London's newly
OL,8,     Fre-emergent theatre scene.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FPianist Kasparas Mikuzis performs
OL,11,     Flive in the studio, and double
OL,12,     Fbassist Leon Bosch chats with
OL,13,     FKatie about his upcoming
OL,14,     Fperformance at Wigmore Hall with
OL,15,     Fthe Ubuntu Ensemble.
OL,16,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,17,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,19,     Ffavourites, from Tchaikovsky to
OL,20,     FReich.
